## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| `x509: certificate signed by unknown authority` | CA not visible to buildah | Confirm `SSL_CERT_FILE` env in the Build and the CA volume mount in `buildah-hl.yaml` |
| `authentication required` on push | Wrong secret type / missing RBAC / nonexistent namespace | Secret must be `dockerconfigjson`; SA needs `system:image-builder`; target namespace must exist |
| `oc get build ... not found` | CRD name collision | Use `oc get builds.shipwright.io` |
| BuildRun pod CrashLoopBackOff | Sidecar injection into build pod | Ensure no `linkerd.io/inject` label/annotation on `openshift-builds` |
| Console BuildRun page crashes (React #310) | OCPBUGS-84214 | Known plugin bug — verify via CLI; fixed in OCP 4.21.19+ |

